('CIT_JM_ATZILUTH_KABBAL','ENT_JM_ATZILUTH','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','Now the Sephiroth are also called the World of Emanations, or the Atziluthic World, or archetypal world, OVLM ATzILVTh, Olahm Atziloth; and this world gave birth to three other worlds, each containing a repetition of the Sephiroth, but in a descending scale of brightness. 58. The second world is the B riati c world, OVLM HBRIAH, Olahm Ha-Briah, the world of creation, also called KVRSIA, Khorsia^ the throne.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_BINAH_KABBAL','ENT_JM_BINAH','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','ckwards," • in retrograde order," or "averse." By the "path of under- standing " is meant Binah, the third Sephira. Schechinah is of course the Divine Presence manifested in the path of Malkuth. I have explained in the Introduction the meaning of the term " path as employed in the Zohar.] 33. But in one balance are they equiponderated.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_CHESED_KABBAL','ENT_JM_CHESED','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','This union of the second and third Sephiroth produced ChSD, Chesed, Mercy or Love also called GDVLH, Gedulah, Greatness or Magnificence; a masculine potency represented by the Divine Name AL, El, the Mighty One, and the angelic name, ChShMLIM, Chashmalim, Scintillating Flames (Ezek, iv. 4). 46. The number 5.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_NETZACH_KABBAL','ENT_JM_NETZACH','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The number 7, The seventh Sephira is NT^Ch, Netzach, or Firmness and Victory, corresponding to the. Divine Name Jehovah Tzabaoth, IHVH TzBAVTh, the Lord of Armies, and the angelic names ALHIM, Elohim, gods, and ThRShIShIM, Tharshisim, the brilliant ones (Dan. x. 6). 49. The number 8.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_QLIPHOTH_KABBAL','ENT_JM_QLIPHOTH','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','also the world of shells, OVLM HQLIPVTh, Olahn Ha-Qliphoth, which is this world of matter, made up of the grosser elements of the other three. In it is also the abode of the evil spirits which are called " the shells " by the Qabalah, QLIPVTH, Qliphoth, material shells. The devils are also divided into ten classes, and have suitable habitations. (See Table.) 61. The Demons are the grossest and most deficient of all forms.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_YESOD_KABBAL','ENT_JM_YESOD','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','These two produced ISVD, Yesod, the Foundation or Basis, represented by AL ChI, El Chai, the Mighty Living One, and ShDI, Shadddi; and among the angels by AShIM, Aishim, the Flames (Ps. civ. 4), yielding the third Trinity of the Sephiroth. 51. The number 10. From this ninth Sephira came the tenth and last, thus completing the decad of the numbers.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_JM_YETZIRAH_KABBAL','ENT_JM_YETZIRAH','SRC_ZOHAR','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','The Kabbalah Unveiled (Zohar: Idras & Siphra Dtzenioutha)','There are a large number of treatises of various dates and merits which go to make up the written Qaba- lah, but they may be reduced to four heads : (a) The Sepher Yetzirah and its dependencies. (P) The Zohar with its developments and com- mentaries. (y) The Sepher Sephiroth and its expansions. (8) The Asch Metzareph and its symbolism. 24. The SPR ITzIRH, Sepher Yetzirah, or " Book of Formation," is ascribed to the patriarch Abraham.','S. L. MacGregor Mathers',1887,'https://sacred-texts.com/jud/tku/',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'OCR scan of Mathers Zohar selections, located by name; verify section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1)
